{"id": "68988", "title": "老公抽你丫的", "author": "艾依一", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68988.htm", "intro": "“宝贝 儿，爱我！我会交出我的所有，包括我的命！”\r\n青天白日下，她被恶劣男人打包带走，每时每刻都对着同一张脸，虽然那张脸长得……呃……不赖！\r\n可看久了也会腻嘛！所以，她要逃……\r\n他爱她，宠她，给她所有的一切，却禁止一切男性生物围绕她，其中包含她的父亲！\r\n她忍无可忍：“喂！姓聂的，你丫的找抽！”\r\n（PS：此文定义为宠文甜文！宠到你心底，甜到腻死你！）", "base": "files/article/html/68/68988", "chapters": [{"title": "1-15", "file": "10553612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-30", "file": "10553613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-44", "file": "10553614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "45-56", "file": "10553615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-70", "file": "10553616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-83", "file": "10553617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "84-90", "file": "10553618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-100", "file": "10553619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-110", "file": "10553620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-120", "file": "10553621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-130", "file": "10553622.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-140", "file": "10553623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-145完结", "file": "10553624.html", "available": false}]}